a&#x0364;nderungen derge&#x017F;talt in ihrem Zu&#x017F;ammenhange und<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Zu&#x017F;tande</fw><lb/>
<pb n="236" facs="#f0264"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">VII.</hi> Ab&#x017F;chn. Erweis, daß die Erde</hi></fw><lb/>
